  "basis": "Using the plotted series as the dashboard evidence: the x-axis orders years 1880 (left) to 1891 (right) and the y-axis 'Number of Tourists' increases upward from 0 to 3,500. The single blue line starts near 1,000–1,100 at 1880 and ends near 3,200 at 1891, with a peak near 3,500–3,600 at 1890; the later endpoint is far above the earlier endpoint, indicating a net increase over 1880–1891. The title's word 'Decreasing' conflicts with this visible data, so it is treated as a mislabel rather than an authoritative override. Because the measured change is a clear increase, the ordinary comparative meaning of the task's 'growth' route applies.",
